---
import Tooltip from './Tooltip.astro';
---

<link rel="preload" href="/self.png" as="image" />

<aside class="sidebar">
  <img src="/self.png" draggable="false" alt="Profile Photo" class="pfp" />
  <h1>Hershraj Niranjani</h1>
  <span class="contact">hershraj [at] berkeley.edu</span>
  <p class="location">San Francisco, CA</p>

  <div class="bio">
    <p>
      Hi! I'm Hershraj. I'm a 20-year-old researcher and engineer finishing up my EECS degree at UC Berkeley. I currently work as a Member of Technical Staff at a stealth-mode startup, where I work on AI-native video.
    </p>

    <p>
      I'm broadly interested in how we can get large models to reason effectively in structured domains. At BAIR, I worked on LLM-guided program synthesis -- figuring out how to get language models to search well over massive spaces of possible programs. I've also published work on multi-agent coordination, looking at how LLM systems can autonomously discover their own behavioral norms rather than relying on hand-designed ones.
    </p>

    <p>
      I've also spent time exploring physics-informed neural networks, timeseries forecasting, and interpretability. I tend to gravitate toward problems where the structure of the domain matters as much as the model itself.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside of research, I love to teach. Helping difficult concepts click is probably the most rewarding thing I do. Always happy to chat about research, interesting problems, or anything else.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="socials">
    <div class="socials-icons">
      <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/hershrajn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="LinkedIn">
        <img src="/socials/linkedin-logo.png" alt="LinkedIn" />
      </a>
      <a href="https://github.com/talkierbox" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub">
        <img src="/socials/github-logo.png" alt="GitHub" />
      </a>
    </div>

    <a
      class="site-code-link"
      href="https://github.com/talkierbox/hershraj-personal-website"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      aria-label="View this website's source code on GitHub"
      title="View this website's source code on GitHub"
    >
      <svg
        class="site-code-icon"
        width="16"
        height="16"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"></polyline>
        <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"></polyline>
      </svg>
      <span>Source code</span>
    </a>
  </div>

  <!-- Mobile: collapse chevron at bottom of bio -->
  <button class="bio-collapse" aria-label="Show sections">
    <svg
      class="bio-collapse-icon"
      width="24"
      height="24"
      viewBox="0 0 24 24"
      fill="none"
      stroke="currentColor"
      stroke-width="2"
      stroke-linecap="round"
      stroke-linejoin="round"
    >
      <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
    </svg>
  </button>

  <!-- Mobile: tabs shown when bio is collapsed -->
  <div class="mobile-tabs"></div>
</aside>
